<p>Vælg et startpunkt fra Attack Surface. Fortsæt derefter fra en kompromitteret komponent via udgående relationer i Asset Model.</p>
<section>
<h2>Opret startkomponent</h2>
<p id="start-empty" hidden>Vælg først et asset på <a href="/attack-surface">Attack Surface</a>.</p>
<form id="start-component-form">
<fieldset>
<label>Attack Surface asset<select name="systemAssetId" required></select></label>
<div class="component-picker"></div>
<label>Likelihood<input name="likelihood" type="number" min="1" max="5" value="3" required></label>
<label>Kommentar<textarea name="comment" maxlength="4000" rows="1"></textarea></label>
<p data-existing class="muted"></p>
<button type="submit">Opret startkomponent</button>
</fieldset>
</form>
</section>
<section><h2>Attack Components</h2><div id="component-list"></div></section>
<div id="selected-component"></div>
